{"4388030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sicko Sanctum", "steam_appid": 4388030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter, the Sicko Sanctum. A codified purgatory created by a bio-engineered god to train righteous souls. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388030/extras/4d98f89686474533988ab7b25aa63286.poster.avif?t=1775519647\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388030/extras/4d98f89686474533988ab7b25aa63286.webm?t=1775519647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388030/extras/4d98f89686474533988ab7b25aa63286.mp4?t=1775519647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obliterate waves of enemy hordes with tight, blisteringly fast classic FPS game-play. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388030/extras/3d042ed6f5e266907c083fea97b56ad5.poster.avif?t=1775519647\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388030/extras/3d042ed6f5e266907c083fea97b56ad5.webm?t=1775519647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With use of unlimited upgrades and ammo, Sicko Sanctum is a no fluff action FPS that will knock your socks off. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388030/extras/c910f49e4ec781311ce190188e721175.poster.avif?t=1775519647\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388030/extras/c910f49e4ec781311ce190188e721175.webm?t=1775519647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388030/extras/c910f49e4ec781311ce190188e721175.mp4?t=1775519647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may be overpowered, however your enemies are even stronger. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create the perfect build, defeat the malevolent Martation Prime, and experience pristine surrealist action heights like no other game in this score attack rogue-like FPS: Sicko Sanctum. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter, the Sicko Sanctum. A codified purgatory created by a bio-engineered god to train righteous souls. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388030/extras/4d98f89686474533988ab7b25aa63286.poster.avif?t=1775519647\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388030/extras/4d98f89686474533988ab7b25aa63286.webm?t=1775519647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388030/extras/4d98f89686474533988ab7b25aa63286.mp4?t=1775519647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obliterate waves of enemy hordes with tight, blisteringly fast classic FPS game-play. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388030/extras/3d042ed6f5e266907c083fea97b56ad5.poster.avif?t=1775519647\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388030/extras/3d042ed6f5e266907c083fea97b56ad5.webm?t=1775519647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With use of unlimited upgrades and ammo, Sicko Sanctum is a no fluff action FPS that will knock your socks off. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388030/extras/c910f49e4ec781311ce190188e721175.poster.avif?t=1775519647\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388030/extras/c910f49e4ec781311ce190188e721175.webm?t=1775519647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4388030/extras/c910f49e4ec781311ce190188e721175.mp4?t=1775519647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may be overpowered, however your enemies are even stronger. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create the perfect build, defeat the malevolent Martation Prime, and experience pristine surrealist action heights like no other game in this score attack rogue-like FPS: Sicko Sanctum. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Sicko Sanctum features fast classic FPS combat in horde based surrealist levels. With unlimited upgrades become overpowered and triumph over powerful enemies. Defeat the malevolent Martation Prime or play infinitely, the Sicko Sanctum doubles as a rogue-like and score attack shooter.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steam